import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.ConstantSheafSingularComparisonCochainNullhomotopy
import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.ConstantSheafSingularComparisonPresheafEvaluation

/-!
# Native coefficient-general singular cochains and their presheaves

This entry point supplies the actual additive duals of the original integer
singular chains, arbitrary abelian coefficients, their literal differentials
and pullbacks, the native integral comparison, and the augmented presheaf
complex on all opens.  Actual nullhomotopies give explicit cochain primitives.

The sheafification and global sheaf-cohomology comparison are separate stages;
no such comparison is assumed or asserted by this cochain package.
-/
